<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;">About your volunteer registration</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Dear {{firstName}}, thank you for your interest in volunteering with {{orgName}}. After reviewing your registration, we are not able to take it forward at this time.</p>
{{#if reason}}
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 16px;border:1px solid rgba(19,35,37,.10);border-radius:12px;">
  <tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;">
    <p style="margin:0;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;">Reason</p>
    <p style="margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;">{{reason}}</p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
{{/if}}
<p style="margin:0;color:#5e6a62;font-size:13px;">If you believe this was a mistake, or your circumstances change, reply to this email and our team will take another look.</p>
